 Week 03 - Ibadan North LGA - Data Preparation

Study Area: Ibadan North Local Government, Oyo State (Area ~27 sq km)
CRS Chosen: EPSG:32631 - WGS 84 / UTM Zone 31N
Reason: Ibadan North lies at approx 3.9°E, within UTM Zone 31N. 

I need metres for area/distance calculations. Geographic CRS EPSG:4326 
uses degrees (0.0004 degree² is meaningless).

What I Reprojected:
- Raw settlement/building data from EPSG:4326 to EPSG:32631
- Ibadan North boundary from EPSG:4326 to EPSG:32631

What I Clipped:
- All reprojected layers clipped to ibadan_north_boundary_32631.gpkg 
using Vector > Geoprocessing > Clip

Five Quality Checks:
1. CRS Defined: PASS - All layers now show EPSG:32631 in Properties > Information
2. Geometry Validity: Checked with Vector > Geometry Tools > Check Validity. [e.g 1 invalid polygon found and fixed with Fix Geometries]
3. Duplicate Features: Checked with Delete duplicate geometries tool. [e.g No duplicates found / 3 duplicates removed]
4. Attribute Completeness: Opened attribute table. [e.g 2 NULL values in 'type' field - flagged]
5. Coverage/Extent: Visual check - data fully covers Ibadan North boundary, no gaps. Overlay matches.

Analysis-Ready File Location:
`data/analysis_ready/ibadan_north_final.gpkg`
